WEBVTT

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:14.670
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.910
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:22.310
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:25.350
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:29.290
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:39.440
<i>The re-extermination of Kazuki seemed</i> <i>to have been completed by Captain Bravo.</i>

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:43.710
<i>But because of the effects of energy drain,</i>
<i>Kazuki was able to barely survive.</i>

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:48.310
<i>Gota, who had seen Tokiko's worry</i> <i>over Kazuki,</i>

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:53.290
<i>decided to challenge</i> <i>the Re-Extermination Squad, and Hiwatari.</i>

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:56.380
<i>The battle ended without a winner</i>

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:59.090
<i>and Gota fled.</i>

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:05.630
<i>And now the escape of Tokiko,</i>
<i>Kazuki, and Gota begins.</i>

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:12.430
<i>The Escape</i>

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:18.040
Warrior Chief Sakimori...

00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:20.870
The re-extermination of Warrior Kazuki, also known as Victor III...

00:01:20.950 --> 00:01:23.180
the order was confirmed and accepted by you.

00:01:23.490 --> 00:01:26.150
Though you had the target right where you wanted him,

00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:28.620
in the end the re-extermination was a failure.

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:32.960
Currently, Victor III is on the run with former alchemist warriors.

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:36.930
Why did you fail to confirm his death?

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:39.660
After bringing the target under control,

00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:41.760
retrieval of the kakugane should have been top priority.

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:45.140
lt's hard to believe that perhaps you had forgotten.

00:01:46.470 --> 00:01:48.030
There has been a report

00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:51.710
that Victor III and you, Warrior Chief, had a personal friendship.

00:01:51.950 --> 00:01:52.880
lf that's the case,

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:55.850
we cannot help but think that you let him go intentionally.

00:01:56.620 --> 00:01:59.020
Warrior Chief Sakimori, do you have anything to say

00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:02.350
in your defense regarding this mission's failure?

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:06.360
May l...say one thing?

00:02:06.530 --> 00:02:08.550
What is it, Warrior Chitose?

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:10.790
Regarding this mission,

00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:14.770
l believe it's necessary to treat it differently from typical missions.

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:17.440
Since the target was a former Alchemist Warrior

00:02:17.510 --> 00:02:19.600
who has begun to transform into Victor.

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:22.910
l wonder if expecting only perfect results

00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:27.810
from a battle against an opponent that has that much power is sound judgment.

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:31.280
l believe the focus should not be on that, but on the power

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:35.880
of Warrior Chief Sakimori's
Buso Renkin to suppress Victor III.

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:38.560
We are currently in a dire situation.

00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:42.220
l believe it's necessary to gather as many people as possible

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:44.990
that may serve as combative force.

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:52.870
May l assume all concerns have been brought to the table?

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:58.310
Well then...

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:03.450
Regarding the failure of
Warrior Chief Sakimori's mission,

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:04.820
l will overlook it this time.

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:09.120
Please quiet down.

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:12.430
l, the Great Warrior Chief Shousei
Sakaguchi, have made this decision

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:16.660
based on the discussion during the inquiry commission meeting.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.730
No objections, then?

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:25.330
Warrior Chief Sakimori, please return to your mission and

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:28.380
continue to pursue the re-extermination of Victor III.

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:30.470
Understood?

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:33.010
Yes, Great Warrior Chief.

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:34.910
There's not much time.

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:38.150
l am expecting you to quickly execute the mission.

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:40.490
ln preparation for the forthcoming battle...

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:42.750
Warrior Chitose...

00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:46.790
There is a need to establish the Victor Search Squad simultaneously.

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:50.420
l delegate you to take full charge.
Understood?

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:51.390
Yes.

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:55.270
With that, the inquiry commission meeting is adjourned.

00:03:58.870 --> 00:04:02.000
Thank goodness... or should l not be saying that?

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:06.380
This mission is too tough on you.

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:08.110
Why do you think so?

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:12.020
l know because we were on the same team before.

00:04:14.590 --> 00:04:18.120
No matter what the mission is, l will stick to my beliefs until the end.

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:19.580
That's all.

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:24.590
<i>Sakimori.</i>

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:31.770
Such a relief.

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:37.170
You shouldn't be relaxing.
We are being pursued, you know.

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:39.650
You say so, but it's still relieving.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:40.880
Gosh...

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:46.720
<i>Underdog!</i>

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:49.250
Damn! l will beat you in force!

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:51.120
Don't pollute the clean stream!

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:54.490
Plus, do those things somewhere out of my sight.

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:58.700
Gee. l thought you two would get along well.

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:01.260
Well, l think we actually got to know each other pretty well now.

00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:02.240
Let's shake hands!

00:05:02.540 --> 00:05:03.370
Hell no!

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:04.670
Nothing has changed.

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:06.470
And wash your hands first!

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:13.680
And you, Gota? You don't feel like getting along with him at all?

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:17.340
Not at all.
Besides, l hate that guy.

00:05:17.990 --> 00:05:20.960
Someday l am going to make him say, "l bow down to you."

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:22.120
l bow down to you.

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:29.860
Well...l said it in place of him, but that's not enough, right?

00:05:30.130 --> 00:05:33.360
l don't want to make you say that.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:34.130
Wha--?

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:39.710
But l want to make you say "l want you."

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:43.180
I'll make you say, "l bow down to you."
Get over here!

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:49.370
Hey Tokiko.

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:52.150
So where are we going from here?

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:54.180
Newton Apple Girls Academy.

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:56.450
That is our destination.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:02.760
That's the school where you retrieved my kakugane.

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:05.490
That's right.

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:08.030
l think it's time to share this with you two.

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:12.130
lt was the mission before l came to Ginsei City.

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:16.470
After hearing about the miracle sacred stone that heals wounds

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:19.540
l smuggled into that school to investigate.

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:33.330
<i>Fake, huh...</i>

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:37.300
<i>The miracle sacred stone</i> <i>that heals wounds</i>

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:39.930
<i>is said to be inherited by the school.</i>

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:43.740
<i>l knew from investigating that</i> <i>it is actually a kakugane...</i>

00:06:43.810 --> 00:06:45.900
<i>but where in the world is the real one?</i>

00:06:56.680 --> 00:07:00.090
<i>Basement, no,</i> <i>or is it an underground cavern.</i>

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:06.490
<i>Found it.</i>

00:07:06.930 --> 00:07:08.490
<i>This completes the mission.</i>

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:11.500
Are you an Alchemist Warrior?

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:14.400
Who are you?

00:07:19.940 --> 00:07:21.500
Go ahead and take it.

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:26.510
That originally belongs to you guys... you may use it.

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:30.150
However, you must not break it.

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:33.480
lf you break it, it will bring disaster.

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:37.350
Next morning, the academy was in chaos,

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:40.220
not due to the sacred stone's destruction but because it was missing.

00:07:41.130 --> 00:07:44.030
The imitation that l broke and the floor l destroyed had been restored,

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:45.960
leaving no trace of destruction.

00:07:46.030 --> 00:07:48.830
The underground cavern had disappeared.

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:53.740
Next day, the Army investigated the academy,

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:56.780
but no evidence to support my report was found.

00:07:57.110 --> 00:07:59.600
This case ended up being suspended.

00:08:00.350 --> 00:08:01.780
But l am sure now.

00:08:01.850 --> 00:08:05.840
That guy knows something regarding Kazuki's black kakugane.

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:08.590
We should head straight to the academy

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:10.780
and find the guy that was in the underground cavern!

00:08:13.730 --> 00:08:16.630
Hey Papi. Where are we heading?

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:18.460
We are not going to find Kazuki and the others

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:20.330
if we just search haphazardly.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:23.770
But l can't just sit around and not do anything.

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:28.740
The ideal style of a butterfly is to dance in the sky.

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:33.010
Gee, l wonder where Kazuki and the others are at right now.

00:08:33.180 --> 00:08:36.880
lt's your master's job to search for them, is it not?

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:43.360
You still can't figure out where Muto and the others went?

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:47.230
No, it seems Tsumura is on the move.

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:50.960
The Army has not yet located them.

00:08:51.070 --> 00:08:52.530
<i>Figure out their possible destinations.</i>

00:08:52.730 --> 00:08:55.360
lt's hard to believe that they are just on a random route

00:08:55.440 --> 00:08:57.230
if that girl is with them.

00:08:57.540 --> 00:09:00.100
They must be headed toward a definite place.

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:03.440
Ouch, hey it hurts, it's gonna break, break!

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:06.000
lt broke!

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:07.870
You're right....

00:09:07.950 --> 00:09:10.440
Okay, l'm going to continue searching for them.

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:14.050
<i>Oh by the way,</i> <i>l have one more thing to ask you.</i>

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:17.120
Where are the people who are after them right now?

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:26.030
Pretty good, huh.

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:29.130
Considering they are just kids and they can run away like this.

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:31.170
They are one of our own,

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:34.040
so it's natural that they have the skills to outwit us.

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:37.740
Then it's all about outsmarting them.

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:41.270
l can't stand them playing around with us anymore.

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:45.480
<i>This is Chitose. Can you hear me?</i>

00:09:45.790 --> 00:09:49.090
What's happening, Chitose?
Did you locate them?

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:52.250
No. l have something that l am concerned about.

00:09:52.430 --> 00:09:53.950
<i>About what?</i>

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:56.860
l noticed while looking through the documents that

00:09:56.930 --> 00:10:00.130
there were some suspicious things in the report regarding

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:02.800
the black kakugane which produced Victor III.

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:07.030
<i>The person executing the mission</i> <i>was Warrior Tokiko</i>

00:10:07.110 --> 00:10:09.130
<i>who is now with Victor III.</i>

00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:12.440
<i>Their goal is to prevent</i> <i>the transformation into Victor III.</i>

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:16.510
lf these factors are taken into consideration when analyzing...

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:19.620
We got them. And that place is?

00:10:19.690 --> 00:10:21.490
Newton Apple Girls Academy.

00:10:22.060 --> 00:10:22.890
lkusabe!

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:28.730
lmpressive that they still have hope in this hopeless situation.

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:30.260
They are only kids

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:32.300
but it seems like we cannot underestimate them.

00:10:32.670 --> 00:10:36.330
Stop saying wussy things.
Let's hurry up and find them--

00:10:39.970 --> 00:10:41.000
What happened?

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:42.840
Seems like we have a guest.

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:45.940
A homunculus?

00:10:46.650 --> 00:10:48.620
Found you.

00:10:58.730 --> 00:11:01.920
Wait a second, Tokiko.
You walk too fast.

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:04.900
Unlike you, we went through and endured the harsh training

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:07.400
with the Alchemist Army.

00:11:07.940 --> 00:11:09.840
This mountain hike is nothing.

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:12.130
l wonder if she gets tired at that pace.

00:11:12.570 --> 00:11:15.270
You don't have to worry because if you are tired

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:18.210
you just have to drain energy bit by bit from others.

00:11:20.050 --> 00:11:21.740
Even if it's a joke, don't say such a thing.

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:24.580
You know what...

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:25.450
Yeah?

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:28.050
lf you are lucky and able to prevent transforming into Victor...

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:29.590
What do you mean "if"?

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:33.420
lf you are able to, do you intend to go back to being an Alchemist Warrior?

00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:36.090
Do you really think that you'll be able to fight alongside

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:38.460
with the people who once tried to kill you?

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:41.670
At least l will be able to fight alongside people

00:11:41.740 --> 00:11:43.300
who have the same feelings as me.

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:47.140
lf we want to protect the same thing,

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:49.340
l bet we can be comrades.

00:11:56.550 --> 00:12:00.950
l see, my my.
Elegant homunculi do exist, huh?

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:05.460
Hey? So there are Alchemist Warriors that have good sense of what's cool.

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:09.060
This is rare to have a homunculus take the initiative

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:12.030
to appear in front of us.

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:13.730
What do you want?

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:16.840
We are actually busy right now, you know.

00:12:17.270 --> 00:12:21.000
Well then.
We are actually also in quite a hurry.

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:26.010
That is why... l will get directly to the point.

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:28.480
Where is Kazuki Muto?

00:12:28.650 --> 00:12:31.810
Muto...are you referring to Victor III?

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:34.120
Do you know him?

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:37.590
lt seems like we cannot just leave you alone.

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:40.690
Leave him to me.

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:43.890
Got it. Then we are going to go ahead.

00:12:44.100 --> 00:12:46.120
Yeah. I'll catch up soon.

00:12:49.070 --> 00:12:50.230
ls that all right?

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:51.630
No problem.

00:12:51.710 --> 00:12:57.810
After all, he has beaten more homunculi than Sakamori and me.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:00.350
He's what you would call a record holder.

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:08.310
Hey homunculus.

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:12.090
l will tell you where they are headed if you win against me.

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:17.520
You better not forget what you just said.

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:20.460
Only if you beat me, that is.

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.800
—Buso Renkin!
—Buso Renkin!

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:41.680
l suppose you have an idea as to why you have been summoned here.

00:13:42.260 --> 00:13:44.320
l guess it is finally going to start..

00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:45.960
lnitial expedition for Victor.

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:48.390
This mission is like the preparatory phase.

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:53.630
Our mission is to search for Victor's location.

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:57.830
We must find Victor and get a foothold for the forthcoming battle.

00:13:58.110 --> 00:14:03.100
Hey, Warrior Chitose. lt's all right if we kill them, right?

00:14:03.510 --> 00:14:07.880
There has been no order to not kill, but there is no need to go that far.

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:11.280
Then it makes things easy.
Let's hurry up and go.

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:12.780
Time to show off my skills.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:14.390
No, not just yet..

00:14:14.990 --> 00:14:17.420
There is one more member who's coming along.

00:14:28.770 --> 00:14:29.700
<i>Be careful!</i>

00:14:30.070 --> 00:14:31.870
That guy is Warrior lkusabe.

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:34.370
Among all current warriors in the Alchemist Army,

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:37.740
he holds the record for killing the most homunculi.

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:40.280
<i>You don't have to tell me,</i> <i>l could tell just by his fighting.</i>

00:14:40.410 --> 00:14:42.180
<i>He has some skills.</i>

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:46.650
Well, it's not like l've been fighting seriously yet either.

00:14:46.790 --> 00:14:50.550
l see. We're both just warming up.

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:55.050
Well then, l guess it's time to get serious.

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:57.320
Don't get too careless, Papi!

00:14:57.630 --> 00:15:01.000
Your opponent is an Alchemist Warrior. lt's hard to tell what power he has!

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:03.040
l know that already.

00:15:03.270 --> 00:15:06.210
But l don't care what he has.

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:10.400
Whatever he has, will just have to be...

00:15:13.310 --> 00:15:17.410
blown away with Near Death Happiness!

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:19.110
Well, well...

00:15:19.190 --> 00:15:21.990
You have a pretty interesting skill.

00:15:22.490 --> 00:15:24.750
Looks like you aren't just a wuss, but...

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:33.630
What the hell is that? lt restored instantaneously!

00:15:33.730 --> 00:15:35.700
Rapid regeneration.

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:38.360
So that's the feature of that cross spear.

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:43.740
You cannot stop my spear's Gekisen with just that level of attack!

00:15:43.740 --> 00:15:45.110
Then how about this?

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:50.380
—The entire arm...
—...is splattered!

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:51.920
Not quite!

00:15:52.520 --> 00:15:53.490
What?!

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:05.770
l got him hard!

00:16:07.970 --> 00:16:10.630
His own body can be restored, huh.

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:13.130
ln that case...take this!

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:18.080
What are you doing?

00:16:19.010 --> 00:16:22.310
Sorry sorry. l forgot to control my strength.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:25.720
lndeed, that was a mistake.

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:29.060
l was planning to gather information on Muto.

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:32.350
This is pretty bad.
There are no pieces left of him...

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:36.260
Don't tell me...

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:45.700
l haven't done a whole body restoration in awhile.

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:48.640
But it's no fun if it's not like that.

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:53.710
Didn't expect him to have more vitality than a homunculus...

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:55.310
Oh boy.

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:02.550
Over there.

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:15.930
Who are you?

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:19.100
l am Warrior Chitose, affiliate of the Alchemist Army.

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:25.880
l have recently been appointed in charge of the Victor Search Squad.

00:17:26.010 --> 00:17:28.920
Shusui Hayasaka. We need your help.

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:31.450
Please come with me.

00:17:38.930 --> 00:17:41.360
Hurry, there's no time to be sluggish.

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:43.920
l know. Let's hurry, Gota.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.970
Don't talk to me so casually.

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:52.500
This is?

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:58.040
A cemetery.

00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:02.110
Looks like you've chosen the perfect battlefield.

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:03.820
You are...

00:18:04.150 --> 00:18:06.120
Warrior Chief, Hiwatari...

00:18:07.760 --> 00:18:10.590
lt's well suited for the last moments of a monster.

00:18:10.660 --> 00:18:14.090
Well, though everything may get blown away if we fight here,

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:16.430
it's about time we end the chase.

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:19.830
Our specialty is not in chasing, but in fighting.

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:23.370
<i>Shoot...we are surrounded...</i>

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:25.900
Victor III, also known as Kazuki Muto.

00:18:26.470 --> 00:18:29.500
ln the name of the Alchemist Army, we are going to re-exterminate you.

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:31.780
Are you ready?

00:18:33.180 --> 00:18:34.550
Hey you sagging eyes.

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:37.850
l have to settle the battle between you and me.

00:18:38.420 --> 00:18:39.410
Be grateful.

00:18:40.190 --> 00:18:42.210
Nobody asked you to do so!

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:44.450
What should we do, Tokiko?

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:46.230
Of course, we have to fight.

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:47.320
Please get out of our way.

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:54.430
l have to move forward in order to return to everyone l care for.

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:59.140
And to once again, protect everyone with my power.

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:03.940
l am not going to cause any more trouble for society and the Army.

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:07.480
ln the worst case scenario, l will put an end to it myself...

00:19:08.520 --> 00:19:10.480
So please, move out of our way!

00:19:10.720 --> 00:19:11.980
Hell no.

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:30.460
lt's no use. No matter how many times he's attacked he restores.

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:31.770
This guy is going against the rules.

00:19:37.910 --> 00:19:40.570
Looks like you are having trouble with your Buso Renkin.

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:43.720
Stamina and mental strength are running out, huh?

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:49.790
You were pretty strong.

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:52.760
Among the 332 that l have defeated so far,

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:54.490
l rank your power to be in the top tier.

00:19:56.600 --> 00:19:58.830
l am going to finish you off, homunculus!

00:19:59.570 --> 00:20:01.800
Don't struggle!
You're going to ruin your reputation!

00:20:02.140 --> 00:20:04.500
What are you saying?

00:20:04.810 --> 00:20:08.740
l've only begun to finally figure out the weakness in your spear.

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:11.080
lf you don't admit your loss, it's only going to weaken your status!

00:20:45.060 --> 00:20:47.220
Roaring flames block my sight.

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:50.750
Even if my body shall burn, l will protect you no matter what.

00:20:51.300 --> 00:20:53.790
As long as you are fine, l don't care what happens to me.

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:56.730
Next, "As Long As l Can Protect You."

00:20:57.170 --> 00:20:59.140
I'll splatter your guts!
